482a1aa98c75a477d430516395c3d7239f243d9c2ad6b44af354e8248ca","text":"1. 由本人、儿子、孙子和外孙分类"},{"id":"A31327-zh-00065","doc":"A31327","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304805","source_hash":"c17bcac157d85c649464d2e380812189df0514756b6bff8108b01c4685deb35f","text":"2. 如果是儿子，则列为“长子”、“次子”、“三子”等。"},{"id":"A31327-zh-00066","doc":"A31327","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304806","source_hash":"70b8863484e9ca1de452093c1ad6c2c7723e2f006c1491431040d29eb270c7d9","text":"3. 对于孙子和外孙，仅列出“孙子，外孙”"},{"id":"A31327-zh-00067","doc":"A31327","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304807","source_hash":"9c4d310899b815c8892a372e81f1200d6f9456f961894f0b8b24a03b855d45f6","text":"在第⑤项的“姓名”栏中，用韩文填写被报告人的姓名（）。"},{"id":"A31327-zh-00068","doc":"A31327","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304808","source_hash":"18914e2916e9f5b75794760bdcfd6d613f6443f89f85ea8b6650e1a0bcd1d7a0","text":")"},{"id":"A31327-zh-00069","doc":"A31327","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304809","source_hash":"dbabb581a860b194098819621d8e316bb1d705822fa7865818a5cf36be047ca1","text":"项目⑥~⑧：省略"},{"id":"A31327-zh-00070","doc":"A31327","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304810","source_hash":"70f186bdbd1b84cd27d63d1f3fb6cd16004e3113828b19010746912733e610d6","text":"在“兵役详情”栏中，请按地区兵役局签发的兵役证明书上的内容，准确记录兵役详情。"},{"id":"A31327-zh-00071","doc":"A31327","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304811","source_hash":"d01abe30f0cf383169c0564b67baf521b4d93b339eb94532a3c58ba07e5ded1a","text":"项目 10 “备注”列为"},{"id":"A31327-zh-00072","doc":"A31327","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304812","source_hash":"dba116e0104f5b242dc5309e4b12017f27284e5debf4e2cbeb9badac0daabc22","text":"如果您是女性，请填写“Female”，"},{"id":"A31327-zh-00073","doc":"A31327","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304813","source_hash":"92d275330da3509a6e3901cdf59ac445ad97caa84b0e019a3a6567a79d5efc95","text":"如果公职候选人的直系后裔根据《公职人员兵役情况报告和披露法》实施令第十四条第二款的规定，要求不披露疾病名称或精神或身体残疾的详情，则必须注明“要求不披露疾病名称（精神或身体残疾详情）”的声明，并且公职候选人或有关人员必须加盖印章或签字。"},{"id":"A31328-zh-00001","doc":"A31328","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304814","source_hash":"98ba384a3db9532e6bcf6f984de4ec1e363858397aaaa5679baa86abfac1c7c2","text":"[附件表格编号 2]"},{"id":"A31328-zh-00002","doc":"A31328","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304815","source_hash":"b5e99e5afe5eeb49c483162b0e70e473a501bf5e9c7cf17ce9aaea1a60425014","text":"公职候选人兵役详情申报收据"},{"id":"A31328-zh-00003","doc":"A31328","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304816","source_hash":"b947df2c0b0aa1daacc01c44b0a7ca5bd6198afd4e7ed39f252494c70eb5110e","text":"①收货日期"},{"id":"A31328-zh-00004","doc":"A31328","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304817","source_hash":"c0b8fe1074156d4ba6e358506e4fab4939eb11409637aa0d034eab29b28d100d","text":"义务报告人的个人信息"},{"id":"A31328-zh-00005","doc":"A31328","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304818","source_hash":"ba7ec85a171924e428c80a751c7b5d89d38e62f5946b8e57512bd2938383764a","text":"②旧"},{"id":"A31328-zh-00006","doc":"A31328","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304820","source_hash":"5b8622af7afb209d01eb9717bbd55a3148bc77e99036331f10dda0d71f2a1deb","text":"③计划"},{"id":"A31328-zh-00007","doc":"A31328","law_id":"kr-006003-35378-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2304821","source_hash":"7d8c439b9a82505671275a24ed68cdf95f481f9a